1) dig abctechnologies.com
    dig NS abctechnologies.com
    theHarvester -d abctechnologies.com -b crtsh
    subfinder -d abctechnologies.com -silent
    whatweb https://abctechnologies.com

2)  dig NS abctecnologies.com
    dig NS abctechnologies.com +short
    dig AXFR abctechnologies.com @ns1-03.azure-dns.com
    dig AXFR abctechnologies.com @ns2-03.azure-dns.net
3) dig NS abctechnologies.com
   dig MX abctechnologies.com
   dig A abctechnologies.com
   curl -I https://abctechnologies.com
   curl -I -L https://abctechnologies.com
